[00:01.44](1 John 4:19)
[00:02.88]1. The pattern of love, we learn from Jehovah
[00:09.76]Shows the way, guides our way.
[00:16.64]In all he has done, his dealings have shown us
[00:23.64]How to display his loving way.
[00:30.64]He gave us his Son, his dearest possession
[00:37.58]To cover our sin, forgiving transgression.
[00:44.58]What proof of his love—its greatest expression!
[00:54.58]His way is love, Yes, God’s way is love.
[01:10.27]2. When we walk his way, our love for each other
[01:18.62]Will be true, warm and true,
[01:26.98]Will move us to care for all of our brothers,
[01:30.91]Old ones and new, not just a few.
[01:34.84]True love for our God and love for our brother,
[01:41.56]We can’t have the one and not have the other.
[01:48.36]The faults of our friends, we readily cover,
[01:55.20]Proving our love, Our brotherly love.
[02:23.04]3. The pattern of love, the bond that unites us
[02:30.24]Lets us be family.
[02:37.04]Our Father above now warmly invites us:
[02:41.04]“Come taste and see real unity.”
[02:47.52]Come share in the love and joy that define us;
[02:57.82]God’s spirit and Word, he gives to refine us.
[03:04.82]Our brothers and friends are here to remind us,
[03:09.02]God’s way is love. Jehovah is love.